    "scope_check": "Implementer-execution against the §5 amended build directive. The heartbeat addition is an implementation-shape call inside the ratified attestation requirement, disclosed rather than absorbed. Conformance #3 is explicitly NOT claimed -- evidence submitted for the strategist's ruling. Two open questions (detection-layer independence; .og-doorbell gitignore) routed rather than decided. Channels adapter untouched.",
    "applies_principles": [
      "no-vendor-capture -- the vendor-neutral transport carries no Anthropic dependency; core reused unchanged rather than forked",
