      "evidence-led -- live run against the real substrate with the seen-count matching the true memo count; the ring produced by a genuine memo rather than a throwaway probe",
      "bounded-authority -- draft, build, propose; nothing committed, pushed or merged; .gitignore call left with the strategist"
    ],
